5. Sahifani pastga tushirib, yashil rangli **"Commit changes"** tugmasini bosing.

Ana shundan keyin yana o'sha **PWABuilder.com** saytiga kiring, GitHub havolangizni qaytadan kiriting. Endi xizmat manifest faylini o'zi avtomatik topadi va **"Package For Stores"** tugmasi yashil/binafsha rangda (faol holatda) yonadi! Unga bosib Android uchun tayyor `.aab` faylni bemalol yuklab olasiz.
